We closed timing on the control plane, tightened the power grid, and completed pre-layout verification across the final branch of the core.

The latest milestone was a full regression pass across synthesis, STA, and gate-level simulation. We also tuned the memory subsystem to avoid back-pressure when the accelerator queue is saturated.

![Laboratory hardware close-up](/meds-ee-uet/images/posts/lab-hardware.jpg)


```verilog
module pipeline_top (
  input  logic        clk,
  input  logic        rst_n,
  output logic [31:0] trace
);
  always_ff @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin
    if (!rst_n) begin
      trace <= '0;
    end else begin
      trace <= trace + 32'd1;
    end
  end
endmodule
```


